+++ b/changelog/69900.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added ``beacons.list_status`` to report, per configured beacon, the time it
+last actually executed and whether that execution raised an error. The data
+is tracked live by the running beacon loop, so it reflects real activity
+without waiting for a new probe cycle, reading log files, or restarting the
+minion. Beacons that are configured but have not fired yet are reported with
+``last_run_time`` and ``last_error`` both set to ``None``.
